WEBVTT

00:00:03.823 --> 00:00:06.093
Listen, brother, what...
about what I said...
我之前说了难听的话 真的很抱歉

00:00:06.126 --> 00:00:07.494
No, I'm the one.
我之前说了难听的话 真的很抱歉

00:00:07.527 --> 00:00:09.896
But I shouldn't have...
-不 是我该道歉
-但是我不该那么说

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:12.065
I'm... I'm sorry.
我很对不起

00:00:12.099 --> 00:00:15.735
Oh, I'm so sorry, Gru.
我也很对不起 格鲁

00:00:15.768 --> 00:00:17.904
Aw...

00:00:17.937 --> 00:00:20.907
-Ooh, look out!
-What is that?
-当心
-那是什么？

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.443
-(snoring)
-Hey. Hey. (speaking Minionese)

00:00:23.476 --> 00:00:25.312
-MEL: Uh, huh?
-(screaming)

00:00:25.345 --> 00:00:28.648
Caramba! Caramba!
Caramba...!

00:00:28.681 --> 00:00:30.650
Mel?
梅尔？

00:00:30.683 --> 00:00:32.585
Huh? Gru?
格鲁？

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:33.920
(whimpers)

00:00:33.953 --> 00:00:36.356
(speaking Minionese, groaning)

00:00:36.389 --> 00:00:38.491
Gru!
(speaking Minionese)

00:00:38.525 --> 00:00:42.229
Gru...!

00:00:44.864 --> 00:00:47.167
(indistinct chatter)

00:00:49.702 --> 00:00:52.005
(loud, rumbling whooshing)

00:00:54.841 --> 00:00:57.144
(thudding footsteps)

00:00:59.746 --> 00:01:02.615
(screaming and whimpering)

00:01:02.649 --> 00:01:04.617
(Balthazar cackling)

00:01:04.651 --> 00:01:06.653
(cackling)

00:01:06.686 --> 00:01:09.956
Hello... Hollywood!
你好 好莱坞

00:01:09.989 --> 00:01:12.625
(through speakers):
I'm back and bigger than ever.
我回来了 比以往更强大

00:01:12.659 --> 00:01:14.661
AGNES (whimpers):
Whoa!
我回来了 比以往更强大

00:01:14.694 --> 00:01:16.496
I'm scared!
我好害怕

00:01:16.529 --> 00:01:19.332
Thank you.
Thank you so... Oh.
谢谢 谢谢大家

00:01:19.366 --> 00:01:22.569
(panicked screaming)
那是什么？机器人吗？好大

00:01:22.602 --> 00:01:24.171
CELEBRITY:
No!
不 别把我扔在这里

00:01:24.204 --> 00:01:26.239
No, you can't leave me here!
不 别把我扔在这里

00:01:26.273 --> 00:01:27.674
I'm famous!
我是明星

00:01:27.707 --> 00:01:29.076
(laughs)
克里夫 准备上大炮

00:01:29.109 --> 00:01:30.677
Clive, arm the cannons.
克里夫 准备上大炮

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:33.646
(whirring)

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.049
BALTHAZAR (through speakers):
Chew on this!
尝尝这个吧

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:37.650
(screaming and shouting
continues)
孩子们在哪儿？太可怕了 快躲起来

00:01:37.684 --> 00:01:39.352
(man yelling)

00:01:39.386 --> 00:01:42.089
(cackling)

00:01:42.122 --> 00:01:46.025
(panicked screaming)

00:01:46.059 --> 00:01:48.828
(stammering, screaming)

00:01:48.861 --> 00:01:50.397
(yelling):
Why?!

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.432
(screaming)

00:01:52.465 --> 00:01:55.102
Hey, mullet head,
let us out!
大胡子男 放我们出去

00:01:55.135 --> 00:01:57.270
Oh, don't worry, girls.
别担心 姑娘们

00:01:57.304 --> 00:02:00.573
I've prepared
a front row seat for you.
我都给你们准备好前排座位

00:02:00.607 --> 00:02:02.509
(whirring,
girls yell and whimper)

00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:06.279
(tires squealing,
people shouting)

00:02:06.313 --> 00:02:09.416
-(yelling)
-(bleating)

00:02:09.449 --> 00:02:12.452
(whimpering and screaming)

00:02:15.788 --> 00:02:17.957
-(screaming)
-Agnes!
艾格妮丝

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.759
-Aah!
-(groaning)
艾格妮丝

00:02:19.792 --> 00:02:21.528
BALTHAZAR (through speakers):
Once again, I win,
我赢了 你们老爸又一次输给了我

00:02:21.561 --> 00:02:23.263
and Gru loses!
我赢了 你们老爸又一次输给了我

00:02:23.296 --> 00:02:25.798
Enjoy the show, girls.
好好欣赏吧 姑娘们

00:02:25.832 --> 00:02:28.135
(all gasping)

00:02:33.273 --> 00:02:34.707
What in the heck?
什么鬼东西？

00:02:34.741 --> 00:02:36.909
Oh, I hope
the girls are okay.
我希望她们三个没事

00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:38.778
Bratt!
Bratt at nine o'clock.
布莱特 他在9点钟方向

00:02:38.811 --> 00:02:41.348
No! three o'clock!
He's on the left!
不 是3点钟 他就在左边

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.618
(gasping)
No! I've seen this episode!
不 我以前看过这一集

00:02:45.652 --> 00:02:47.120
He's going to bubble gum
他要用泡泡糖裹住整座城市
再送上太空

00:02:47.154 --> 00:02:49.122
the whole city
and send it up into space!
他要用泡泡糖裹住整座城市
再送上太空

00:02:49.156 --> 00:02:51.424
-(gasps) Hurry!
-(Dru gasps)
快点

00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:53.360
(loud, thudding footsteps)

00:03:01.534 --> 00:03:03.836
Oh, this is it!
This is it!
就是这样 灯光 相机 激光

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.806
Lights! Camera! Laser!
就是这样 灯光 相机 激光

00:03:06.839 --> 00:03:08.341
(whooshing)
就是这样 灯光 相机 激光

00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:11.544
(high-pitched whirring)

00:03:13.546 --> 00:03:17.317
(yelling, screaming)

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.486
Ah, yeah.

00:03:19.519 --> 00:03:21.321
(high-pitched screaming)

00:03:21.354 --> 00:03:23.956
(popping, explosion)
（大世界唱片）

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.526
LUCY (gasps):
Look!
在那儿 我去救她们
你们两个去对付布莱特

00:03:26.559 --> 00:03:28.361
I've got the girls.
You two, go take care of Bratt.
在那儿 我去救她们
你们两个去对付布莱特

00:03:28.395 --> 00:03:30.830
Wait! What are you doing?
等等 你在干什么？

00:03:32.199 --> 00:03:35.101
Hyah. (grunts)

00:03:35.134 --> 00:03:37.036
Hyah. Oh.

00:03:37.069 --> 00:03:38.438
Look, you guys, it's Lucy!
你们快看 那是露西

00:03:38.471 --> 00:03:40.940
Lucy, over here! Help!
Help us!
露西 在这里 救命 救救我们

00:03:40.973 --> 00:03:42.309
Mama's comin', girls.
妈妈来了 姑娘们

00:03:42.342 --> 00:03:44.477
-Lucy! Lucy!
-We're up here! Lucy!
露西 我们在这儿

00:03:44.511 --> 00:03:46.779
BALTHAZAR:
Look at that laser go.
看这激光多漂亮

00:03:46.813 --> 00:03:49.015
I love it
when a plan comes together.
我就喜欢顺利的计划

00:03:49.048 --> 00:03:51.451
Aah! It's Gru!
格鲁来了

00:03:51.484 --> 00:03:54.053
(Gru laughs)

00:03:54.086 --> 00:03:56.489
Get ready, Bratt.
You're about to be blasted
做好准备 布莱特

00:03:56.523 --> 00:03:58.691
back to the '80s!
我今天要把你轰回80年代

00:04:01.328 --> 00:04:04.697
(explosions)

00:04:04.731 --> 00:04:06.499
-Oh.
-(whooping)

00:04:10.102 --> 00:04:12.705
Oh-ho! We got him!
我们打败他了

00:04:12.739 --> 00:04:15.074
(loud metallic creaking)

00:04:16.509 --> 00:04:21.481
(Balthazar yelling)

00:04:21.514 --> 00:04:22.915
-Oh, no!
-Don't worry.
-糟了
-别担心

00:04:22.949 --> 00:04:24.717
There's more
where that came from.
我们带来的弹药多着呢

00:04:24.751 --> 00:04:27.754
-It'll take more than that
to stop me. -(Clive beeps)
你想阻止我可没有那么容易

00:04:27.787 --> 00:04:30.189
-Bratt Pack, go get that
barf bag. -(Clive laughing)
坏小子们 去抓住那个死秃头

00:04:32.525 --> 00:04:34.727
(dolls laughing)

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.932
Oh, incoming!
过来了

00:04:39.966 --> 00:04:41.401
(laughing)

00:04:41.434 --> 00:04:43.002
(groaning)
真难缠 你这个...闪开 都给我下去

00:04:43.035 --> 00:04:44.170
You little...
真难缠 你这个...闪开 都给我下去

00:04:44.203 --> 00:04:46.906
Get away! Get out of here!
真难缠 你这个...闪开 都给我下去

00:04:46.939 --> 00:04:49.942
(laughing, explosion)

00:04:49.976 --> 00:04:51.744
(high-pitched whirring)

00:04:51.778 --> 00:04:52.945
Quick, jump!
快点 跳

00:04:52.979 --> 00:04:54.281
(yelling)
快点 跳

00:04:54.314 --> 00:04:57.049
-(thudding)
-Bonus!
惊喜 你看到了没有 克里夫？
都完了

00:04:57.083 --> 00:04:58.951
Did you see that, Clive?
All gone.
惊喜 你看到了没有 克里夫？
都完了

00:04:58.985 --> 00:05:01.554
-(Clive beeps)
-Buh-bye, Wonder Twins.
再见 神奇双胞胎

00:05:01.588 --> 00:05:03.356
(yelling)

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:08.194
(groaning)

00:05:08.227 --> 00:05:11.063
(yelling, whimpering)

00:05:11.097 --> 00:05:14.934
-(whirring)
-(groans)
（粘性）

00:05:14.967 --> 00:05:17.304
(groaning)

00:05:20.106 --> 00:05:21.574
Whoa. Ooh-la-la.

00:05:21.608 --> 00:05:23.810
(speaking Minionese)

00:05:23.843 --> 00:05:26.613
(whirring)

00:05:26.646 --> 00:05:30.116
(low rumbling,
glass breaking)

00:05:30.149 --> 00:05:31.818
(groaning)
救命

00:05:31.851 --> 00:05:33.753
-Help!
-Hang on!
抓紧

00:05:35.087 --> 00:05:37.290
(grunting)

00:05:38.591 --> 00:05:40.159
(grunts)

00:05:40.192 --> 00:05:41.994
-(girls yelling)
-Hang on, girls!
撑住 姑娘们 我来救你们

00:05:42.028 --> 00:05:43.963
-I got you!
-(groaning)
撑住 姑娘们 我来救你们

00:05:43.996 --> 00:05:46.466
I can't!
I'm slipping!
撑不住 我在往下滑

00:05:46.499 --> 00:05:47.934
(screaming)

00:05:47.967 --> 00:05:50.269
No!
不

00:05:50.303 --> 00:05:51.904
-(all screaming)
-Got ya!
抓住了

00:05:51.938 --> 00:05:53.973
(yelling)

00:05:54.006 --> 00:05:55.908
Oh, thank you, Lucy!
谢谢你 露西

00:05:55.942 --> 00:05:57.710
Let's go!
We're not safe yet.
我们走 这里不安全

